{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forelegs are better than two as you journey across mountains, thickets and plains in search of your lost herd. Master Fight, Flight and Freeze responses to fend off foes in snappy, turn-based battles of wits, then take in the scenery and have a good roll before trotting on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a horse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713310/extras/aefef72f3691fa4fe48b6a5f9f46f498.poster.avif?t=1768563777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713310/extras/aefef72f3691fa4fe48b6a5f9f46f498.webm?t=1768563777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713310/extras/aefef72f3691fa4fe48b6a5f9f46f498.mp4?t=1768563777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a horse in search of their lost herd. Graze grass. Spook at an umbrella. Roll in the mud. Let those legs run wild!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique turn-based encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713310/extras/94eb2996d5f9c5cd92ef199146f7d4d6.poster.avif?t=1768563777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713310/extras/94eb2996d5f9c5cd92ef199146f7d4d6.webm?t=1768563777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713310/extras/94eb2996d5f9c5cd92ef199146f7d4d6.mp4?t=1768563777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand your ground in short, turn-based encounters using body language to intimidate foes into backing down before your resolve wavers. Learn more than 80 behaviours and master switching between Fight, Flight and Freeze states to gain the upper <span class=\"bb_strike\">hand</span>\u00a0hoof. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friend or foe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713310/extras/b30050b7011b928d34ab13ac2b0a2bb1.poster.avif?t=1768563777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713310/extras/b30050b7011b928d34ab13ac2b0a2bb1.webm?t=1768563777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713310/extras/b30050b7011b928d34ab13ac2b0a2bb1.mp4?t=1768563777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form alliances with characters you meet along the way to help you fend off even the most fearsome opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the wilderness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713310/extras/31074a87d548bfb428f079fa308380d6.poster.avif?t=1768563777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713310/extras/31074a87d548bfb428f079fa308380d6.webm?t=1768563777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713310/extras/31074a87d548bfb428f079fa308380d6.mp4?t=1768563777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an untamed wilderness filled with hand-drawn characters and environments\u00a0as you piece together events leading up to the disappearance of your herd.</p>","backgrou